{"5115030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Woodworking Game", "steam_appid": 5115030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Furniture. Complete Contracts. Create Your Own Workshop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of your own woodworking shop and craft tables, benches, crates, and much more for your customers. Earn money, buy new lumber, hinges, and paint—and expand your workshop step by step, just the way you want it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Board to Finished Furniture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the table saw, planer, and workbench to shape your lumber. Work on each part, then assemble everything into creations of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2b64b00466e6ecc36f5ea2dfb3c6c7d6.poster.avif?t=1788067443\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2b64b00466e6ecc36f5ea2dfb3c6c7d6.webm?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2b64b00466e6ecc36f5ea2dfb3c6c7d6.mp4?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Freeform Nailing System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join pieces of wood wherever you choose. Select the nail length and hammer every nail into the wood yourself. Turn simple components into sturdy tables, chairs, crates, and many other projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2379ba9e4a7952029a978291c4ef9337.poster.avif?t=1788067443\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2379ba9e4a7952029a978291c4ef9337.webm?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2379ba9e4a7952029a978291c4ef9337.mp4?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix Your Own Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy primary colors along with white and black, then mix exactly the shade you need. Paint furniture, lumber, walls, or even the floor to give your workshop a personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/fa17938d4b884a4dcfcf4aef60554309.poster.avif?t=1788067443\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/fa17938d4b884a4dcfcf4aef60554309.webm?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/fa17938d4b884a4dcfcf4aef60554309.mp4?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Entire Workshop Is Your Canvas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design not only your furniture, but the entire space. Put up new walls, build platforms, create storage rooms, shelves, and supply crates, or set up a break room. You can even clad the walls and ceilings entirely in wood—what your workshop ultimately looks like is up to you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Furniture. Complete Contracts. Create Your Own Workshop.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take charge of your own woodworking shop and craft tables, benches, crates, and much more for your customers. Earn money, buy new lumber, hinges, and paint—and expand your workshop step by step, just the way you want it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Board to Finished Furniture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the table saw, planer, and workbench to shape your lumber. Work on each part, then assemble everything into creations of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2b64b00466e6ecc36f5ea2dfb3c6c7d6.poster.avif?t=1788067443\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2b64b00466e6ecc36f5ea2dfb3c6c7d6.webm?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2b64b00466e6ecc36f5ea2dfb3c6c7d6.mp4?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Freeform Nailing System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join pieces of wood wherever you choose. Select the nail length and hammer every nail into the wood yourself. Turn simple components into sturdy tables, chairs, crates, and many other projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2379ba9e4a7952029a978291c4ef9337.poster.avif?t=1788067443\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2379ba9e4a7952029a978291c4ef9337.webm?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/2379ba9e4a7952029a978291c4ef9337.mp4?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mix Your Own Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy primary colors along with white and black, then mix exactly the shade you need. Paint furniture, lumber, walls, or even the floor to give your workshop a personal touch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/fa17938d4b884a4dcfcf4aef60554309.poster.avif?t=1788067443\" width=1170 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/fa17938d4b884a4dcfcf4aef60554309.webm?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/extras/fa17938d4b884a4dcfcf4aef60554309.mp4?t=1788067443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Entire Workshop Is Your Canvas</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design not only your furniture, but the entire space. Put up new walls, build platforms, create storage rooms, shelves, and supply crates, or set up a break room. You can even clad the walls and ceilings entirely in wood—what your workshop ultimately looks like is up to you.</p>", "short_description": "Run your own woodworking shop, complete customer orders, and craft furniture by hand. Saw and plane lumber, join parts with a freeform nailing system, mix paint, and customize your entire workshop just the way you want.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Dutch, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Czech, Turkish, Ukrainian, Hungarian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/0ec07afd4d13d1b8cd51ff6a1d4c71300280867f/header.jpg?t=1788067443", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115030/35a8139e0acb00a7cc54c528f04d2940fa2a4849/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788067443", "caps